<h2 id="colors">Colors</h2>
{% include "partials/design-tokens.njk" %}
{% markdown %}
Use `--kh-cart-paper`, `--kh-cart-ink`, `--kh-cart-blue`, `--kh-cart-yellow`, `--kh-cart-red` and `--kh-cart-green`. The swatches above consume the live tokens. Yellow and red are large decorative accents. Use white/cobalt, white/green, ink/paper and cobalt/paper for text. Muted text uses `--kh-ink-muted` (`#5b5e5a`).

The [design guide palette](/style-guide/design/#palette) records contrast and colour roles. Existing aliases keep earlier components in step: `--kh-ground` maps to paper; `--kh-color--blue` and `--kh-color--apparatus` map to cobalt; rules use neutral ink. `--kh-panel-bg` is white, `#ffffff`, to lift grouped content from the paper ground. Visited reading links retain `--kh-color--visited` (`#563d82`).
{% endmarkdown %}

