{% markdown %}
Use details for secondary material, not to hide the opening argument, a required action or the only explanation of a data point. A summary can contain an appropriate heading; match the page outline. Do not insert a second interactive control inside the summary.

`.kh-details` is the retained bordered content disclosure. `.kh-cartridge-contents` is the separate article-contents treatment, assembled by `layouts/post.njk`; its summary owns the contents navigation. Do not replace either with a clickable div. Source: `index.scss`, `_kh-cartridge.scss` and `src/site/_includes/layouts/post.njk`.
{% endmarkdown %}

