- `.kh-table-scroll` contains a genuinely wide table instead of making the page scroll.
- `.kh-table--stack` opts a suitable record table into cards below 846px. Add `data-label` to cells that need a header in this view; titles and reference IDs need not repeat obvious labels.
- Keep the full table when relationships depend on comparing columns. Do not stack a data matrix merely to avoid horizontal scrolling.

Sources: `_kh-datasheet.scss`, `_kh-cartridge-system.scss`; a production example is `src/site/work.njk`.
